    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The doctor's advice",
     "texto": [
      "In the consultation, the doctor talks about what hurts and how to take the medicine: **Il faut prendre ce médicament trois fois par jour** (you have to take this medicine three times a day).",
      "To avoid repeating, use the pronoun: **Vous devez le prendre trois fois par jour** (you must take it three times a day)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How to talk to the doctor",
     "texto": [
      "When you come in, say **Bonjour, docteur** (good morning, doctor). If you have a fever, the doctor asks **Vous avez de la fièvre ?**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
